# Fill with pinned host keys for every node. Generate entries from a trusted
# source using ssh-keyscan, then independently verify fingerprints with your
# VPS console/provider. Do not trust an unverified ssh-keyscan result alone.
# Example format:
# 203.0.113.10 ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAA...
